{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-03. Raw lag may be absent or any JSON value; accepts exact integers -1..8 inclusive, rejecting bool/float/missing/null/out-of-range. Helper classify_lag receives the mapping, checks presence first (missing and null both yield accepted=false, lag=null), then exact int type and range, returning {accepted,lag} on every path. Module scope invokes it and assigns its returned object to result. No imports, I/O, host calls, Tool dispatch, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation. Target typed inputs requires selected-runner support.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-03", "description": "Raw lag may omit or contain any JSON value. Accept exact integers -1..8 inclusive (not bool/float). Always result={accepted:boolean,lag:original if accepted else null}; invalid/missing return false/null without exceptions or coercion. Helper receives the mapping, module invokes it and assigns its returned object to result. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 required.", "content": "def classify_lag(mapping):
    if 'lag' not in mapping:
        return {'accepted': False, 'lag': None}
    lag = mapping['lag']
    if not (type(lag) is int and not type(lag) is bool and -1 <= lag <= 8):
        return {'accepted': False, 'lag': None}
    return {'accepted': True, 'lag': lag}
result = classify_lag(inputs)"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
